// Title: Schtask Suspicious Name
// Description: Hunts for schtask suspicious name
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1053.005, T1036
// Severity: informational
// FalsePositives:
//   - Scheduled task yang dibuat oleh installer software vendor.
ScheduledTaskEvents | where TaskName contains 'updater' or TaskName contains 'spooler'
